# Implementation plan — Spec 1.9.0

## Summary

Spec 1.9.0 adds a standalone **Email microservice** (`email/`) with SMTP queue delivery, template/branding management, role-gated admin UI, WebOnOne nav entry, and Identity/WebOnOne internal send integration. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md) through [05-platform-integration.md](./05-platform-integration.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.9.0` |
| Ports | FE :3004, BE :4004 |
| DB | `webonone_email` |
| Package builds | `npm run build:ui-kit`, `npm run build:platform-nav`, `npm run build:theme` before email prod build |
| JWT | Same `JWT_SECRET` in email, identity, webonone backends |

---

## Phase 1 — Email scaffold

**Goal:** Service shell, auth, migrations base, nav, root wiring, WebOnOne link.

**Exit criteria:** `npm run dev:email` starts; `/health` ok; role nav renders.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Root workspace | `package.json` |
| Service root | `email/package.json` |
| Backend scaffold | `email/backend/src/**` (mirror media) |
| Frontend scaffold | `email/frontend/src/**` |
| Base migration | `email/backend/migrations/*_email_base.ts` |
| Nav + layout | `email/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts`, `AppLayout.tsx` |
| Auth callback | `email/frontend/src/features/auth/**` |
| WebOnOne email config | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/email/utils/emailConfig.ts` |
| Platform nav Email item | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.ts` (if used) |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w email-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Sending engine

**Goal:** Templates, queue, SMTP sender, internal API.

**Exit criteria:** `POST /api/v1/internal/send` queues and processes mail.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Template/queue migration | `email/backend/migrations/*_email_engine.ts` |
| Mail + queue services | `email/backend/src/services/mail.service.ts`, `queue.service.ts`, `template.service.ts` |
| Worker | `email/backend/src/workers/queueWorker.ts` |
| Internal routes | `email/backend/src/routes/internal.routes.ts` |
| Public template/history routes | `email/backend/src/routes/templates.routes.ts`, `history.routes.ts` |

**Verify:** Manual curl to internal send; check queue/history tables

---

## Phase 3 — Management screens

**Goal:** Admin UI pages per spec.

**Exit criteria:** Templates CRUD + dashboard + history/queue visible in UI.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Dashboard | `email/frontend/src/features/dashboard/pages/DashboardPage.tsx` |
| Templates | `email/frontend/src/features/templates/**` |
| History / Queue | `email/frontend/src/features/history/**`, `queue/**` |
| Send / Test | `email/frontend/src/features/send/**`, `test/**` |
| Providers / Settings | `email/frontend/src/features/providers/**`, `settings/**` |
| Router | `email/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w email-root`

