## Phase 4 — Platform integration

**Goal:** Identity reset/verify + WebOnOne company emails + role sync.

**Exit criteria:** Release checklist in [05-platform-integration.md](./05-platform-integration.md).

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Email client helper | `identity/backend/src/services/emailClient.service.ts`, `webonone-v2/backend/src/services/emailClient.service.ts` |
| Identity auth hooks | `identity/backend/src/services/auth.service.ts` |
| WebOnOne company hooks | `webonone-v2/backend/src/services/company.service.ts` |
| Role sync route | `email/backend/src/routes/internal.routes.ts` |
| Env examples | `identity/backend/.env.example`, `webonone-v2/backend/.env.example` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`, `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

---

## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Identity redirect | Email FE login via auth code |
| JWT | Email BE verifies locally |
| Internal HTTP | Identity/WebOnOne BE → Email `POST /api/v1/internal/send` with `X-Email-Service-Key` |
| WebOnOne nav | Redirect to `VITE_EMAIL_ORIGIN` |

