## Risks and open items

- Dev SMTP may be unavailable — queue should record failures without crashing service.
- Role sync: lazy upsert on first JWT login acceptable if WebOnOne sync deferred.
- Template editor is textarea-only for 1.9.0 (no rich HTML editor).

